<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>WebSocket on Winner's Dev Notes</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/tags/websocket/</link><description>Recent content in WebSocket on Winner's Dev Notes</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-US</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 11:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://releaseleaf.com/tags/websocket/rss.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Reliable WebSocket Reconnection in Cocos Creator: Heartbeats, Backoff and App Resume</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/cocwssreco.html</link><pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 11:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/cocwssreco.html</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;WebSocket code often looks correct in a browser preview but fails in a real game build. Put the app in the background for a few minutes, switch networks, or let a router silently drop an idle TCP connection and the common result is the same: the socket object still exists, but the player can no longer receive game messages.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;The fix is not to call &lt;code&gt;new WebSocket()&lt;/code&gt; from every error callback. A reliable client needs a small state machine that owns the socket lifecycle:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Cocos Creator Shared WebSocket: Connection Service and Message Subscribers</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/cocrshweco.html</link><pubDate>Tue, 16 May 2023 21:33:30 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/cocrshweco.html</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="create-a-shared-websocket-connection"&gt;Create a Shared WebSocket Connection&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#create-a-shared-websocket-connection"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Class A can create the WebSocket connection and expose it through a shared service or, in a small browser project, through a global reference:&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-1"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-1"&gt; 1&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-2"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-2"&gt; 2&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-3"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-3"&gt; 3&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-4"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-4"&gt; 4&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-5"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-5"&gt; 5&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-6"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-6"&gt; 6&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-7"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-7"&gt; 7&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-8"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-8"&gt; 8&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-9"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-9"&gt; 9&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-10"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-10"&gt;10&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-ts" data-lang="ts"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kr"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;socket&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;WebSocket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;wss://your-socket-url&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nb"&gt;window&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kr"&gt;as&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="kt"&gt;any&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;socket&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;socket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;socket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;addEventListener&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;open&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;WebSocket connection established&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;});&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;socket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;addEventListener&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;message&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;event&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;Class A received WebSocket data&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;event&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;data&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;});&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&lt;/tr&gt;&lt;/table&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#10;&lt;/div&gt;&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;p&gt;Class B can obtain the same object and add another listener:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Cocos Creator WebSocket: Connect, Send and Parse JSON or Binary Data</title><link>https://releaseleaf.com/cocrwecose.html</link><pubDate>Wed, 19 Apr 2023 22:02:52 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://releaseleaf.com/cocrwecose.html</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="connect-and-handle-websocket-events"&gt;Connect and Handle WebSocket Events&#13;&#10;&lt;a class="header-anchor" href="#connect-and-handle-websocket-events"&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&#13;&#10;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Pay attention to the data format expected by the server and deserialize incoming payloads according to their type.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#13;&#10;&lt;div class="highlight"&gt;&lt;div class="chroma"&gt;&#10;&lt;table class="lntable"&gt;&lt;tr&gt;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-1"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-1"&gt; 1&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-2"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-2"&gt; 2&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-3"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-3"&gt; 3&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-4"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-4"&gt; 4&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-5"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-5"&gt; 5&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-6"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-6"&gt; 6&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-7"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-7"&gt; 7&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-8"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-8"&gt; 8&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-9"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-9"&gt; 9&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-10"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-10"&gt;10&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-11"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-11"&gt;11&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-12"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-12"&gt;12&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-13"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-13"&gt;13&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-14"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-14"&gt;14&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-15"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-15"&gt;15&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-16"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-16"&gt;16&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-17"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-17"&gt;17&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-18"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-18"&gt;18&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-19"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-19"&gt;19&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-20"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-20"&gt;20&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-21"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-21"&gt;21&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-22"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-22"&gt;22&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-23"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-23"&gt;23&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-24"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-24"&gt;24&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-25"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-25"&gt;25&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-26"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-26"&gt;26&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-27"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-27"&gt;27&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-28"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-28"&gt;28&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-29"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-29"&gt;29&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-30"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-30"&gt;30&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-31"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-31"&gt;31&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-32"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-32"&gt;32&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-33"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-33"&gt;33&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-34"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-34"&gt;34&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-35"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-35"&gt;35&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-36"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-36"&gt;36&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-37"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-37"&gt;37&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-38"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-38"&gt;38&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-39"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-39"&gt;39&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="lnt" id="hl-0-40"&gt;&lt;a class="lnlinks" href="#hl-0-40"&gt;40&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#10;&lt;td class="lntd"&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"&gt;&lt;code class="language-ts" data-lang="ts"&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="kr"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;ws&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="k"&gt;new&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;WebSocket&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;wss://example.com/socket&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;ws&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;binaryType&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;arraybuffer&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;;&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;ws&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;onopen&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;()&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="o"&gt;=&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;console&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;log&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp;#39;Connected&amp;#39;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;);&lt;/span&gt;&#10;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="line"&gt;&lt;span class="cl"&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;ws&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;send&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;JSON&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="nx"&gt;stringify&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="p"&gt;({&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;Version&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="p"&gt;{&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="nx"&gt;Version&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class="o"&gt;:&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="s1"&gt;&amp